&"text": "有控制，甚至冷却时间只有1秒，只要15点蓝。.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"19": {
&"id": "19",
&"next_id": "21",
&"text": "魔抗 201的英雄.",
&"type": "response"
},
"2": {
&"id": "2",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end!",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"20": {
&"id": "20",
&"next_id": "end",
&"text": "转换姿态时甚至可以刷新W的cd，还有真实伤害。~",
&"type": "response"
},
"21": {
&"character": "M",
&"id": "21",
&"next_id": "22",
&"text": "然后，护甲和魔抗提升后还能获得技能加速,",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"22": {
&"character": "bloodking1",
&"id": "22",
&"next_id": "23",
&"text": "缩短Q的cd，还缩短释放时间，然后还有攻击力。W就啊啊啊啊啊啊!!!",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"23": {
&"id": "23",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end!",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
